menu "Cloudflare Tunnel (esp-cf-tunnel)"

    config CF_TUNNEL_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "Tunnel task stack size"
        default 8192
        help
            Stack of the task started by cft_tunnel_start(). Request handlers
            run in this task, so add what they need.

